Thoron: remove the chrome://eggs and chrome://robot pages.

Thorium adds two hidden pages that only show pictures. Thoron is a product for everyday use, and every
WebUI page is attack surface, so both pages, their URL constants, their permission to make network
requests and their images are removed. chrome://authors, which credits the Thorium authors, stays.

Origin: Thoron
Author: KuchiSofts
License: BSD-3-Clause

